ow:E&gt;A\">3</span> to Wealth</li><li><span data-count=\"5\" data-count-of=\"flow:E&gt;D\">5</span> to Checks</li><li><span data-count=\"1\" data-count-of=\"flow:E&gt;EC\">1</span> to Your household</li></ul></li><li class=\"wa-card\" data-part=\"EC\" data-lit=\"true\"><p class=\"nm\">Your household</p><p class=\"q\">Who lives with the results?</p><p class=\"mt wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"title\">How the economy reaches a household</p><p class=\"lt\">This question reaches here</p><p class=\"ct\"> </p><ul class=\"wa-fl\"></ul></li><li class=\"wa-card\" data-part=\"TC\" data-lit=\"false\"></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"wa-sec wa-bsec\" data-oa-section=\"Questions\" aria-labelledby=\"a20-1440-light-answer-s2\"><div class=\"ws-g\"><div class=\"wa-sband oa-surface-charcoal ws-panel\"><h2 class=\"ws-h2\" id=\"a20-1440-light-answer-s2\">Start from a question</h2><div class=\"wa-lede\"><p>Press a question to see which parts of the system decide it.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"ws-g\"><div class=\"wa-col12\"><div class=\"wa-hubs\" data-oa-part=\"questions\"><div class=\"wa-hub\"><p class=\"lab\">Cost of living</p><div class=\"wa-qs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Cost of living\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW01\" data-parts=\"A EC TC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Your household and Technology.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why did my rent go up?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW02\" data-parts=\"X A D EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Outside forces, Wealth, Checks and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why is my grocery bill higher?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW03\" data-parts=\"A EC TC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Your household and Technology.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why is my electric bill going up?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW04\" data-parts=\"X A EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Outside forces, Wealth and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why did my home insurance premium go up?</span></button></div></div><div class=\"wa-hub\"><p class=\"lab\">Health and care</p><div class=\"wa-qs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Health and care\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW05\" data-parts=\"A D EC TC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Checks, Your household and Technology.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why is it hard to find an appointment?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-pathway=\"PW06\" data-parts=\"A D EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Checks and Your household.\"><svg class=\"oa-toggle-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-icon=\"U-selected-check\" data-icon-family=\"utility\"><use href=\"#oa-sym-u-selected-check-24px\"></use></svg><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why can the same care produce different bills?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW07\" data-parts=\"A EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why does childcare cost so much, and why can't I find an opening?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW08\" data-parts=\"A EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why is it so hard to get help at home as I age or live with a disability?</span></button></div></div><div class=\"wa-hub\"><p class=\"lab\">Work and financial security</p><div class=\"wa-qs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Work and financial security\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW09\" data-parts=\"A EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why isn't my pay keeping up with what my work produces?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW10\" data-parts=\"A EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">How do taxes and benefit rules change what my household keeps?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW11\" data-parts=\"A D EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Checks and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">What will I get from Social Security, and could the rules change before I retire?</span></button></div></div><div class=\"wa-hub\"><p class=\"lab\">Public services where you live</p><div class=\"wa-qs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Public services where you live\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW12\" data-parts=\"D EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Checks and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Who makes sure my tap water is safe?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW13\" data-parts=\"X D EC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Outside forces, Checks and Your household.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why is the repair on my street taking so long?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW14\" data-parts=\"X B D\" data-say=\"This question reaches Outside forces, Voice and Checks.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Why does my child's school have less than schools in other districts?</span></button></div></div><div class=\"wa-hub\"><p class=\"lab\">Voice, power and information</p><div class=\"wa-qs\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Voice, power and information\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW15\" data-parts=\"X B C D\" data-say=\"This question reaches Outside forces, Voice, Elections and Checks.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">Which election decides who represents me, and how can I influence the people who decide?</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"oa-toggle wa-q\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-pathway=\"PW16\" data-parts=\"A B D TC\" data-say=\"This question reaches Wealth, Voice, Checks and Technology.\"><span class=\"oa-toggle-label wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"question\">How do algorithms affect the prices I pay, my job, what I see online and the services I get?</span></button></div></div></div><p class=\"wa-small wa-status\" role=\"status\">This question reaches Wealth, Checks and Your household.</p></div><div class=\"wa-col8\"><div class=\"wa-answer\" data-oa-part=\"answer\"><p class=\"lab\">The short answer</p><p class=\"ws-p wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"short_answer\">Most of a medical bill’s price comes from a private contract. Each insurer or employer plan negotiates its own rates with each hospital and clinician, so a scan can cost widely different amounts within one city. Hospitals with few nearby rivals win higher rates, and Medicare pays more for some services in hospital outpatient departments than in doctors’ offices. RAND, a nonprofit research organization, found private plans paid hospitals 254% of Medicare rates in 2022 <a class=\"oa-chip oa-chip--link wa-claim\" href=\"#a20-1440-light-answer-claim-cl1340\" data-atlas-kind=\"Claim\" data-atlas-id=\"CL1340\" data-evidence-href=\"#a20-1440-light-answer-claim-cl1340\">Claim <span class=\"oa-chip-id\">CL1340</span></a>. For medicines, the manufacturer sets a list price protected by patents, and pharmacy benefit managers negotiate rebates off that price, so a patient’s coinsurance can still be based on the full list price.</p><details class=\"oa-disclosure wa-cl\" id=\"a20-1440-light-answer-claim-cl1340\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"oa-disclosure-summary\"><span class=\"oa-disclosure-label\"><span class=\"oa-chip\" data-atlas-kind=\"Claim\" data-atlas-id=\"CL1340\">Claim <span class=\"oa-chip-id\">CL1340</span></span> in full</span><svg class=\"oa-disclosure-chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-icon=\"U-chevron\" data-icon-family=\"utility\"><use href=\"#oa-sym-u-chevron-24px\"></use></svg></summary><div class=\"oa-disclosure-body\"><p class=\"wa-small wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"claim\">In 2022, employers and private insurers paid hospitals 254% of what Medicare would have paid for the same services, with wide differences by state.</p><dl class=\"wa-dl\"><div><dt>Grade</dt><dd><b>Well supported</b>, strong research evidence</dd></div><div><dt>People</dt><dd>Privately insured patients in participating employer and insurer data</dd></div><div><dt>Place</dt><dd>United States, by state</dd></div><div><dt>Period</dt><dd>2020 to 2022</dd></div><div><dt>Limit</dt><dd>Claims come from participating employers and insurers, not a random sample of all private plans.</dd></div><div><dt>Sources</dt><dd>RAND Corporation, Prices Paid to Hospitals by Private Health Plans: Hospital Price Transparency Study, Round 5, 2024</dd></div></dl></div></details></div></div></div></section></main></div></div></div></div></foreignObject></svg></div>"
  }
 ],
